    {
      "bbox": [
        454,
        972,
        1486,
        1484
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "b. An Office of Technology shall be created within DoITT to provide the Committee with all assistance necessary to its operations. The Office of Technology shall seek to identify best practices in the area of information technology and shall serve as a clearinghouse for information to agencies in regard thereto. The Office will also identify opportunities for benchmarking and replicating successful solutions among city agencies.",
